{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make a Hit!</strong> is a puzzle roguelike themed around mixing cassettes in the 80s to climb to the top of the Billboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/placing_cassette.gif?t=1744907841\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Scoring</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Match cassettes on different attributes and combine powerful cassette modifiers to <strong>boost your sales</strong> and mix those coveted <strong><i>Diamond</i></strong> hits!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/diamond_score.gif?t=1744907841\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase your notoriety and sign with increasingly challenging Record Labels to <strong>make loads of cash</strong> and, just maybe, reap the rewards of the rare <strong>Perfect Contract Bonus</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rerolling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Risk your cash to <strong>shuffle the board</strong> or be surgical with your rerolls and fish for that one perfect cassette.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/shuffle.gif?t=1744907841\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Vinyls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect rare Vinyls to inspire your compositions and pass your rivals on the Billboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/vinyl.gif?t=1744907841\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match countless audio samples to craft the perfect song.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Illustrate colourful album covers to capture the essence of your musical creations in visual form.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/smile.gif?t=1744907841\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Are you Ready?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It\u2019s time to follow your dreams. It\u2019s time to climb the Billboard. It\u2019s time to Make a hit!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505860?t=1744907841","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505860?t=1744907841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/d397e92a694298946e77005aac89ad27fa973309/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744907841","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/d397e92a694298946e77005aac89ad27fa973309/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744907841","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make a Hit!</strong> is a puzzle roguelike themed around mixing cassettes in the 80s to climb to the top of the Billboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/placing_cassette.gif?t=1744907841\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Scoring</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Match cassettes on different attributes and combine powerful cassette modifiers to <strong>boost your sales</strong> and mix those coveted <strong><i>Diamond</i></strong> hits!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505860/extras/diamond_score.gif?t=1744907841\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase your 